    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "It\u2019s time to celebrate the ideals of 1776 in the year 2026. \ud83c\uddfa\ud83c\uddf8 \ud83c\uddfa\ud83c\uddf8\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2060396422340759659",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-29T16:22:42+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Courage doesn\u2019t simply mean you have deep convictions. It means you are willing to make a sacrifice to advance those convictions, even at considerable personal loss.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2060369922568634585",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-29T14:37:24+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "There are two Ohios we could wake up to on Nov 4. It can be an Ohio where we celebrate success, faith, family, patriotism, and hard work. Or it can be an Ohio led by a socialist who rejects the values that made us great. That\u2019s up to us to choose.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2060352971343630801",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-29T13:30:02+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Congrats Shrey! \ud83d\udcaa\ud83c\udffc\n\n\nColumbus Dispatch (@DispatchAlerts)\n\nShrey Parikh, 14, wins Scripps National Spelling Bee in dramatic Spell-Off. dispatch.com/story/sports/20\u2026\n\n\n\n\n\u2014 https://nitter.net/DispatchAlerts/status/2060187035021750403#m",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2060189615307501792",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-29T02:40:55+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "This is obviously 100% fake, originally fabricated by a leftist blogger with mental health issues. On one hand, I really didn\u2019t want to respond because it\u2019s so dumb. On the other hand, it\u2019s Exhibit A of how toxic politics works & it happens often enough that I feel some obligation to lift the curtain on how the game is played. So here goes:\n\nI\u2019m a Cavs fan. Love going to their games, always have, I\u2019ve been going for decades. My wife and I bought courtside tickets for Game 4 against the Knicks, a",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2060138959913762932",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-28T23:19:38+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "The #1 factor that determines whether you achieve your goals is you. That\u2019s a premise of the American Dream &amp; we will restore it.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2060087976001175981",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-28T19:57:02+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "The government we elect is the government we deserve.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2060017117534335221",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-28T15:15:28+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Here\u2019s something Ohioans are demanding &amp; I\u2019m delivering: a clear plan to bring down healthcare costs. Starts with quick wins in the first 6 months, and moves to long-run solutions from there.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2059450572156408213",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-27T01:44:13+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Found some common ground over common sense: crush Medicaid fraud &amp; put that money back in Ohioans\u2019 pockets.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2059449440084381854",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-27T01:39:43+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Independent estimates indicate $1.1 trillion (yes, *trillion*) in improper Medicaid payments over the last decade. In Ohio, Medicaid enrollment increased from 2.9 to 3 million, while Medicaid spending ballooned from $27 to $47 billion. That\u2019s unacceptable.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2059442361734987839",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-27T01:11:36+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Prosecuting Medicaid fraudsters is important to actually preserve the Medicaid dollars that are supposed to go to the law-abiding, hardworking families who depend on it as a temporary form of assistance.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2059441157898399774",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-27T01:06:49+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Chris Cuomo was skeptical of the extent of waste, fraud, &amp; abuse in Medicaid, but I shared my view: it\u2019s undoubtedly in the billions in Ohio alone &amp; that money belongs in the pockets of law-abiding Ohioans.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2059439031684051326",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-27T00:58:22+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Individual, family, nation, and God beats race, gender, sexuality, and climate.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2059427549122568340",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-27T00:12:44+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "The one-and-only @DrOzCMS gave me a challenge in the backyard today. Practice what we preach! \ud83d\udcaa\ud83c\udffc\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2059337514666897438",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-26T18:14:58+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Great to welcome Dr. Oz to my home. We discussed how to bring down healthcare costs quickly. Crushing Medicaid fraud is the obvious first step.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2059325549919797580",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-26T17:27:26+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Date night in Cleveland. Let\u2019s go Cavs\u2026all the way back!",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2059074302381867366",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-26T00:49:04+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Today I\u2019m thinking of Gold Star families like Gary and Karla Ward, whose son Christian served as an Army Specialist when he was killed. I\u2019ve met families like them across Ohio, and their sacrifice is something that most of us can\u2019t imagine. We owe them gratitude for the freedoms we enjoy and which we should never take for granted.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2059021581058523419",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-25T21:19:34+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "This Memorial Day, we remember the fallen men & women who made the ultimate sacrifice, and we honor them by supporting those they left behind. The Gold Star families who bear unimaginable burdens deserve our enduring support. The veterans who served alongside the fallen deserve our care and the opportunities they earned. Happy Memorial Day, across Ohio & our country.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2058937687088988397",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-25T15:46:12+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Medicaid fraud isn\u2019t a victimless crime. Everyone pays higher healthcare costs as a result - because the fraud artificially increases demand for healthcare services &amp; diverts taxpayer $$ away from its intended recipients.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2057649264298504525",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-22T02:26:28+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
